<title>HUNGARY: AGRIMPEX REPORTS LOWER IAS PROFITS IN 1996.</title>
<headline>AGRIMPEX REPORTS LOWER IAS PROFITS IN 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996, ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				    Jan-Dec 1996   Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit     435.2	vs     955.9</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	 151.7	vs     812.9</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit     116.7	vs     675.3</p>
<p>    Group sales		 19,236.5	vs  15,373.3</p>
<p>    Costs of sales	    16,093.8	vs  12,818.0</p>
<p>    Net financial income	 283.5 loss vs     143.0 loss</p>
<p>    Taxation			  35.0	vs     137.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Agrimpex Rt is an agricultural trading company.</p>
<p>The figures are consolidated and they were prepared in</p>
<p>accordance with International Accounting Standards. The 1996</p>
<p>figures are not audited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
